00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:39.550
Let's battle!

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:42.550
Just what I was hoping for.

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:48.600
Yell-chan, it's too bad, but your batting has a great weakness.

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:49.310
Weakness?

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:53.230
Here I go, Yell-chan!

00:18:56.450 --> 00:18:57.650
Come...

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:07.860
Strike!

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:11.380
You are weak against things that shake.

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:15.900
As long as you have this weakness, you will not hit my pitch.

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:17.840
I win, Yell-chan!

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:26.160
Don't be depressed.

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:29.950
Yell is Najimi's important maid.

00:19:29.950 --> 00:19:31.270
Owner.

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:34.480
Well, Yell also lost.

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:38.020
Count it as even, all right, Melon?

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:41.050
Do as you like.

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:49.580
Hey, are you still moping around?

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:51.040
Not really.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:54.520
Anyway, don't rush by yourself.

00:19:54.520 --> 00:19:57.130
I can't be at your side all the time.

00:19:57.520 --> 00:19:59.280
All you have to do is be there by my side, right?

00:19:59.280 --> 00:20:00.840
Hey...

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:08.150
That sure was troublesome, the baseball match between Melon-kun and Yell-kun...

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:11.020
How do you know about that?

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:13.270
From this past event, you should understand.

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:17.480
The Akikan Elect is still running.

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:22.350
Idiot! I will crush the Akikan Elect!

00:20:22.350 --> 00:20:26.640
Even if Melon appears to be involved in the fight, I will stop it!

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:28.940
Kakeru, that call just now...

00:20:29.890 --> 00:20:32.500
Oh yeah, Melon. Let's make a quick stop on the way home.

00:20:36.510 --> 00:20:38.160
Kakeru, this...

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:40.120
Of course, this is your cellphone.

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:41.000
Mine?

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:46.390
It's difficult to be near you all the time, so with this you can contact me whenever.

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:50.990
Feel free to use it, even if you don't have anything important to talk about.

00:20:51.910 --> 00:20:53.820
See.

00:20:53.820 --> 00:20:58.440
Even you probably have things that are hard to talk about face-to-face.

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:00.860
Kakeru...

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:05.490
Ah! H-Hey!

00:21:07.510 --> 00:21:10.090
I wonder if her mood will improve anytime soon...

00:21:13.420 --> 00:21:15.110
Kakeru, you idiot!

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:24.240
Why are you making that stupid face? If it's like that, you'll look more like an idiot.

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:27.490
It's meaningless to use the mobile phone so close to each other, idiot.

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:30.970
I don't want to be told that by you, Bakakeru!

00:21:31.150 --> 00:21:33.240
You are noisy, dented can.

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:36.310
What did you say? You Bakakeru, Bakakeru!

00:21:36.310 --> 00:21:38.380
Dented can, dented can, dented can, dented...

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:39.870
Bakakeru!

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:18.830
So it's true that idiocy won't be cured even through death.

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:21.960
Anyway, in the next episode, I'm sure Bakakeru will do something stupid...

00:23:22.350 --> 00:23:24.460
A date with Najimi at the pool?

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:29.370
I didn't hear about that! Explain it to me, Kakeru!
